sequenceDiagram
    participant Cart as :feature:cart screen
    participant Route as CheckoutRoute (:core:navigation)
    participant Nav as NavController (:app graph)
    participant Checkout as :feature:checkout destination

    Cart->>Route: navigate(CheckoutRoute(cartId))   // knows the route, not the screen
    Route->>Nav: type-safe navigate
    Nav->>Checkout: resolve destination (wired in :app)
    Note over Cart,Checkout: :feature:cart has NO dependency on :feature:checkout
